; Stage 15 W9 item 8: the literal channel must not lose the SIGN. -1 is
; representable in every signed target and in none of the unsigned ones, so
; `(as ui8 -1)` is refused even though its magnitude is tiny — a range test that
; compared magnitudes would wrap it to 255 silently.
;
; Compiling this must FAIL with:
;   "as: lossy conversion from i32 to ui8 -- use unsafe/cast"
(defn main ():i32
  (let (a:ui8 (as ui8 -1))
    (return (as i32 a))))
